sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Redis

    Note over Client,Redis: Syntax Error Example
    Client->>Redis: MULTI
    Redis->>Client: OK
    Client->>Redis: SET key value
    Redis->>Client: QUEUED
    Client->>Redis: SYNTAX-ERROR
    Redis->>Client: (error) ERR syntax error
    Client->>Redis: EXEC
    Redis->>Client: (error) EXECABORT Transaction discarded because of previous errors.

    Note over Client,Redis: Runtime Error Example
    Client->>Redis: MULTI
    Redis->>Client: OK
    Client->>Redis: SET key value
    Redis->>Client: QUEUED
    Client->>Redis: HGET key field (operates on wrong type)
    Redis->>Client: QUEUED
    Client->>Redis: EXEC
    Redis->>Client: 1) OK<br>2) (error) WRONGTYPE Operation against a key holding the wrong kind of value